369 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (Build a reliable AI support operations platform that can:\nIngest company support documents and retrieve relevant policy context.\nTriage incoming support tickets by intent, priority, and escalation need.\nGenerate grounded draft replies with citations from the knowledge base.\nSuggest safe operational actions - replacement, refund review, coupon creation, or escalation.\nRequire human approval before executing sensitive actions.\nDefend against prompt injection, unsupported policy claims, PII leakage, and excessive agency.\nTrack evaluations and the minimum trace data needed to debug AI decisions.)
/K [7]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 370 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
endobj
